# The image is built from the repository root but needs only app/ and
# service/ sources; keep the build context small, deterministic and free of
# host-built artefacts (node_modules and dist are rebuilt inside the image).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/*.log

# Repository areas the service image does not build from.
.git
.github
.claude
docs
tasks
report
orchestrator
e2e
api
scripts

# The build files themselves and docs never belong in the context.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
compose.yaml
README.md
app/README.md
service/README.md
service/cmd/pre-receive
